# Triton model version directory.
#
# model.plan is NOT committed and is NOT copied into any image. It is the
# Milestone 4 FP16 engine, bind-mounted read-only over this directory at run
# time by scripts/run_container.sh. An engine is a machine-specific artifact
# bound to one TensorRT version and GPU; committing one would be unusable
# elsewhere and unverifiable here.
